{"articleNo":"41395","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=41395&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012-1학기 대학원 박사과정 학생 석사이수학점 인정 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.03.02","hit":"6844","attachments":[{"name":"대학원 박사과정 학생 석사 이수학점인정 신청원(서식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=41395&attachNo=1425"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffcccc\" height=\"86\" valign=\"center\" width=\"556\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY울릉도M'; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">2012-1학기 대학원 박사과정 학생</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY울릉도M'; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">석사이수학점 인정 신청 안내</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; 2012-1학기 대학원 박사과정 학생의 석사이수학점인정 신청에 관한 사항을 안내하오니 해당 학생들은 참고하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 학점인정 대상 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">동일계열로서 석사과정에서 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">전공과목</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">으로 24학점을</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">초과하여 취득한 학점</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 인정학점 : 6학점까지</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가.</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">초과 이수학점이 최소 3학점 이상이어야 함</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 초과학점이 4학점인 경우 : 3학점 1과목 인정 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 제출서류 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 박사과정 학생 석사 이수과목 학점인정 신청원 1부.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 석사과정 성적증명서 1부.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 제출일자 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2012. 03. 12(월) ~ 03. 15(목) [4일간]</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;5. 제출장소 : 대학원 각 학과 종합학사행정실</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;6. 참고사항 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -146.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 146.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 학점인정 방법 : 해당 학과 교육과정에 편성된 과목으로 인정하되 학</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -146.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 146.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;점은 인정되나 평점에는 반영되지 않으며 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -146.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 146.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; “S”로 표기 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">됨 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 학점인정 시기 : 신청 당해 학기</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2012. 02.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\">금오공과대학교 대학원장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
